// Pipeline health, workspace scope. Inputs (let statements prepended by Terraform): max_age: timespan
// Liveness without App Insights: every FinOps run writes a row per cold resource, so an estate of any
// size has rows daily. Returns one row when the newest row is older than max_age (or there is none).
O11yFinOpsFindings_CL
| summarize LastRow = max(TimeGenerated)
| where isnull(LastRow) or LastRow < ago(max_age)
| project HoursSinceLastRow = iff(isnull(LastRow), 48.0, round(datetime_diff("minute", now(), LastRow) / 60.0, 1))
